\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Who is He, in yonder stall,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  At whose feet the shepherds fall?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \i0  'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par  'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par   At His feet we humbly fall;
\par  Crown Him, crown Him Lord of all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.   Who is He, in yonder cot,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   Bending to His toilsome lot?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \i0  'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par  'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par   At His feet we humbly fall;
\par  Crown Him, crown Him Lord of all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.   Who is He, in deep distress,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  Fasting  in the wilderness?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \i0  'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par  'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par   At His feet we humbly fall;
\par  Crown Him, crown Him Lord of all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   Who is He that stands and weeps
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  At the grave where Lazarus sleeps?
\par 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par  '\i0 Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par  'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par   At His feet we humbly fall;
\par  Crown Him, crown Him Lord of all.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   Lo! At midnight, who is He
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  prays in dark Gethsemane?
\par 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par  '\i0 Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par  'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par   At His feet we humbly fall;
\par  Crown Him, crown Him Lord of all.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6.   Who is He, in Calvary's throes,
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  Asks for blessings on His foes?
\par 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par  '\i0 Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par  'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par   At His feet we humbly fall;
\par  Crown Him, crown Him Lord of all.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7.  Who is He that from the grave
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0  Comes to heal and help and save?
\par 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \i0  'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par  'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par   At His feet we humbly fall;
\par  Crown Him, crown Him Lord of all.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 8\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 8.   Who is He that from his throne
\par \pard          Rules the world of light alone?
\par 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \i0  'Tis the Lord! O wondrous story!
\par  'Tis the Lord, the King of Glory!
\par   At His feet we humbly fall;
\par  Crown Him, crown Him Lord of all.
